    "The proposed single storey rear extension, by reason of its excessive height above natural ground level, substantial depth, and close siting along the boundary with No. 6 Holmwood Close, results in an overbearing form of development that causes harm to the outlook and amenity of the neighbouring property, contrary to Policy CS1 of the Harrow Core Strategy (2012), Policy DM1 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013), and the London Borough of Harrow’s Residential Design Guide Supplementary Planning Document (2010)."
